  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.AI (IChatClient) integration for LiteRtLmSharp on-device LLM inference. Works with Microsoft Agent Framework, Semantic Kernel, and any IChatClient consumer. Companion to the LiteRtLmSharp package. Unofficial community bindings, not affiliated with or endorsed by Google. LiteRT is a trademark of Google LLC.",
